asr-000210
00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:17.420
Presentation video: nahihiya po ako.

asr-000211
00:14:17.420 --> 00:14:19.420
Presentation video: Tapos nung marunong na po akong magbasa,

asr-000212
00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:21.420
Presentation video: hindi na po ako nahihiya.

asr-000213
00:14:21.420 --> 00:14:23.420
Presentation video: Tapos masaya na po ako.

asr-000214
00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:25.420
Presentation video: Dahil po sa bagong

asr-000215
00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:27.420
Presentation video: classroom, mas enjoy po akong

asr-000216
00:14:27.420 --> 00:14:29.420
Presentation video: mag-aral nang mabuti para

asr-000217
00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:31.420
Presentation video: maging doctor paglaki.

asr-000218
00:14:31.420 --> 00:14:37.130
Presentation video: Ngayon na may internet na

asr-000219
00:14:37.130 --> 00:14:39.130
Presentation video: ang school, mas natututuhan nila yung

asr-000220
00:14:39.130 --> 00:14:41.130
Presentation video: lessons nila nang mabilis. At sa mga visual learners

asr-000221
00:14:41.130 --> 00:14:43.130
Presentation video: namin, nakikita nila using

asr-000222
00:14:43.130 --> 00:14:45.130
Presentation video: internet kung paano yung mga lessons na-apply

asr-000223
00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:47.130
Presentation video: sa totoong buhay.

asr-000224
00:14:47.130 --> 00:14:49.130
Presentation video: At kapag mas matibay ang simula,

asr-000225
00:14:49.130 --> 00:14:51.130
Presentation video: mas maraming pagkakataon ang

asr-000226
00:14:51.130 --> 00:14:53.130
Presentation video: nagbubukas.

asr-000227
00:14:53.130 --> 00:14:55.130
Presentation video: Mas maganda po yung new curriculum, lalo na po

asr-000228
00:14:55.130 --> 00:14:57.130
Presentation video: pagdating namin sa Grade 12,

asr-000229
00:14:57.130 --> 00:14:59.130
Presentation video: may tinatawag na doorway option (cross-track) na puwede

asr-000230
00:14:59.130 --> 00:15:00.960
Presentation video: kaming kumuha ng isang elective subject

asr-000231
00:15:00.960 --> 00:15:02.020
Presentation video: kung gusto namin.

asr-000232
00:15:02.280 --> 00:15:05.560
Presentation video: Maganda siya para sa akin kasi nakakatulong po ako sa pamilya ko.

asr-000233
00:15:05.780 --> 00:15:07.880
Presentation video: And I'm currently now a make-up artist po.

asr-000234
00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:11.420
Presentation video: Pero walang batang umaabot doon nang mag-isa.

asr-000235
00:15:11.980 --> 00:15:15.900
Presentation video: Kailangan niya ng gurong may sapat na oras at suporta.

asr-000236
00:15:16.020 --> 00:15:19.320
Presentation video: Dati, full-load,

asr-000237
00:15:19.700 --> 00:15:21.920
Presentation video: madaming gawain, dismissal na pero kailangan ko pa ring tapusin.

asr-000238
00:15:22.220 --> 00:15:24.180
Presentation video: Pero ngayon, naging mas magaan.

asr-000239
00:15:24.360 --> 00:15:27.720
Presentation video: Mas naka-focus na ako sa aking mga tungkulin bilang guro sa mga bata.

asr-000240
00:15:27.720 --> 00:15:31.980
Presentation video: Sa wakas po, mapapagaan po nito ang aming trabaho.

asr-000241
00:15:32.680 --> 00:15:35.760
Presentation video: At makakapag-focus po kami sa pagtuturo namin.

asr-000242
00:15:38.020 --> 00:15:40.340
Presentation video: Siyempre, nandiyan yung number one bond paper,

asr-000243
00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:42.060
Presentation video: ink for printer namin.

asr-000244
00:15:42.320 --> 00:15:43.940
Presentation video: Kahit paisa-isang bilihan mo,

asr-000245
00:15:44.000 --> 00:15:46.240
Presentation video: pero kapag binilang mo at pinagsama-sama,

asr-000246
00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:48.100
Presentation video: marami rin siya at malaki talaga.

asr-000247
00:15:48.820 --> 00:15:51.600
Presentation video: We are grateful na nadagdagan yung teaching allowance namin

asr-000248
00:15:51.600 --> 00:15:54.720
Presentation video: kasi malaking tulong para sa gayon,

asr-000249
00:15:54.840 --> 00:15:58.020
Presentation video: mas maturuan at maibigay namin yung pangangailangan ng mga bata.

asr-000250
00:15:59.060 --> 00:16:02.360
Presentation video: At hindi lang trabaho ang kailangang gumaan.

asr-000251
00:16:02.600 --> 00:16:06.760
Presentation video: Kailangan ding magkaroon ng pagkakataong umunlad ang guro.

asr-000252
00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:10.500
Presentation video: Ngayon ay nakikita na rin namin ang aming landas

asr-000253
00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:13.400
Presentation video: para sa aming growth or pag-unlad,

asr-000254
00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:15.440
Presentation video: lalong-lalo na sa aming pagtanda.

asr-000255
00:16:16.440 --> 00:16:18.960
Presentation video: There are times na nakakalimutan na rin namin yung sarili naming well-being,

asr-000256
00:16:19.240 --> 00:16:20.540
Presentation video: sarili naming health.

asr-000257
00:16:20.680 --> 00:16:23.040
Presentation video: With this medical allowance,

asr-000258
00:16:23.360 --> 00:16:28.020
Presentation video: nagkaroon kami ng pakiramdam na the government is also looking

asr-000259
00:16:28.020 --> 00:16:30.100
Presentation video: at our physical well-being.

asr-000260
00:16:30.440 --> 00:16:31.560
Presentation video: At sa paaralan,

asr-000261
00:16:31.800 --> 00:16:35.860
Presentation video: ang pag-aalaga ay hindi nagtatapos sa pagtuturo.

asr-000262
00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:38.140
Presentation video: Sa hirap talaga ng buhay ngayon,

asr-000263
00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:41.980
Presentation video: talagang masasabi kong napakalaking tulong

asr-000264
00:16:41.980 --> 00:16:44.960
Presentation video: para sa aming mga magulang yung feeding program na ito.

asr-000265
00:16:45.700 --> 00:16:50.060
Presentation video: Minsan, may mga bagay na hindi mo kayang sabihin sa parents and friends mo,

asr-000266
00:16:50.060 --> 00:16:52.140
Presentation video: at nakakagaan po ng loob

asr-000267
00:16:52.140 --> 00:16:56.460
Presentation video: kapag may taong nakikinig at may concern sa iyo.

asr-000268
00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:57.720
Presentation video: Bilang magulang,

asr-000269
00:16:57.720 --> 00:17:02.500
Presentation video: kampante kami dahil hindi lang natututukan

asr-000270
00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:04.100
Presentation video: ang kanilang pag-aaral,

asr-000271
00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:06.100
Presentation video: kundi ang kanilang kaligtasan.

asr-000272
00:17:07.000 --> 00:17:08.100
Presentation video: Kahit may sakuna,

asr-000273
00:17:08.660 --> 00:17:13.500
Presentation video: kaming mga guro at mga bata ay alam na po yung mga paghahanda at dapat gawin.

asr-000274
00:17:13.960 --> 00:17:16.540
Presentation video: Sa katunayan, may mga safety measures na po kami, may mga materials po kami.

asr-000275
00:17:16.540 --> 00:17:18.040
Presentation video: At para magawa ito,

asr-000276
00:17:18.760 --> 00:17:22.960
Presentation video: dapat maihatid ang mga pangangailangan ng bawat paaralan.

asr-000277
00:17:23.180 --> 00:17:24.640
Presentation video: Maganda yung epekto,

asr-000278
00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:27.560
Presentation video: mabilis at maayos yung dating ng mga learning

asr-000279
00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:29.560
Presentation video: materials sa school.

asr-000280
00:17:29.560 --> 00:17:31.560
Presentation video: Kasi nagiging masaya yung mga estudyante,

asr-000281
00:17:31.560 --> 00:17:36.030
Presentation video: yung mga teachers.

asr-000282
00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:38.030
Presentation video: Ang daming tumutulong sa ating paaralan,

asr-000283
00:17:38.030 --> 00:17:40.030
Presentation video: yung ating mga stakeholders na laging nandiyan

asr-000284
00:17:40.030 --> 00:17:42.030
Presentation video: para tumulong sa mga needs ng school.

asr-000285
00:17:42.030 --> 00:17:47.030
Presentation video: Pero mas napapadali ang pagtulong kapag sentralisado

asr-000286
00:17:47.030 --> 00:17:51.030
Presentation video: at malalaman na mismo kung ano ang pangangailangan ng paaralan.

asr-000287
00:17:51.030 --> 00:17:54.030
Presentation video: Mas panatag po kami ngayon dahil ramdam namin

asr-000288
00:17:54.030 --> 00:17:57.030
Presentation video: na ang bawat piso ay nagagamit nang tama

asr-000289
00:17:57.030 --> 00:18:01.030
Presentation video: at napupunta talaga sa edukasyon ng mga bata.

asr-000290
00:18:01.030 --> 00:18:06.030
Presentation video: May mga nasimulan na. At mas marami pa tayong gagawin.

asr-000291
00:18:06.030 --> 00:18:11.030
President Bongbong Marcos (video): Edukasyon pa rin ang siyang pangunahing nagtataguyod ng kakayahan.

asr-000292
00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:17.030
President Bongbong Marcos (video): Kung kaya, ito ang nangunguna sa listahan ng administrasyong ito.

asr-000293
00:18:17.030 --> 00:18:20.030
Presentation video: Kaya malinaw ang susunod na hakbang:

asr-000294
00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:37.800
Presentation video: ituloy ang nasimulan at palawakin ang naaabot.

asr-000295
00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:40.800
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Thank you very much Madam Chair for the opportunity.

asr-000296
00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:45.800
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: For fiscal year 2027, the proposed national expenditure program or NEP budget

asr-000297
00:18:45.800 --> 00:18:51.800
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: for the DepEd is P975.96 billion including funding for attached agencies

asr-000298
00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:56.800
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: namely the National Book Development Board, NBDB, P169.9 million,

asr-000299
00:18:56.800 --> 00:18:59.800
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: National Council for Children's Television, P76 million,

asr-000300
00:18:59.800 --> 00:19:02.800
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: National Museum of the Philippines, P1.56 billion,

asr-000301
00:19:02.800 --> 00:19:05.800
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Philippine High School for the Arts, P135.3 million,

asr-000302
00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:08.800
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Teacher Education Council, P360.3 million,

asr-000303
00:19:08.800 --> 00:19:20.810
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: and the National Academy of Sports, P258.5 million.

asr-000304
00:19:20.810 --> 00:19:32.810
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: This slide presents the comparative budget for the 2026 NEP, 2026 GAA, and 2027 NEP, Madam Chair.

asr-000305
00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:39.810
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: The 2027 NEP level budget amounts to P975.96 billion as mentioned earlier

asr-000306
00:19:39.810 --> 00:19:41.810
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: which is P39.35 billion lower

asr-000307
00:19:41.810 --> 00:19:44.810
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: than the 2026 GAA.

asr-000308
00:19:44.810 --> 00:19:52.810
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Karamihan po sa ating attached agencies ay nakapagtala ng lower budget levels

asr-000309
00:19:52.810 --> 00:19:56.810
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: for fiscal year 2027 compared to the fiscal year 2026 GAA

asr-000310
00:19:56.810 --> 00:20:01.810
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: except for the National Museum of the Philippines which received a higher proposed allocation.

asr-000311
00:20:01.810 --> 00:20:05.370
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Next slide please.

asr-000312
00:20:05.370 --> 00:20:13.370
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: This slide, Madam Chair, Your Honors, presents the comparison of the 2026 NEP versus GAA versus 2027 NEP.

asr-000313
00:20:13.370 --> 00:20:15.370
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: For DepEd proper alone.

asr-000314
00:20:15.370 --> 00:20:23.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So, personal services continues to go up and represents about 79% of the total budget

asr-000315
00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:26.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: at around P766 billion approximately.

asr-000316
00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:32.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: MOOE and capital outlay both decreased compared to the 2026 GAA.

asr-000317
00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:39.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: MOOE declined by P33 billion while capital outlay records a large decrease of P67 billion.

asr-000318
00:20:39.000 --> 00:20:44.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Ito po yung overall picture.

asr-000319
00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:47.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Next slide please.

asr-000320
00:20:47.000 --> 00:20:55.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: This slide presents the budget utilization rate of DepEd which obligation stands at 51.54%

asr-000321
00:20:55.000 --> 00:21:02.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: as of August 20, 2026 and disbursement rate of 89.28%, Your Honor.

asr-000322
00:21:02.000 --> 00:21:04.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Next slide please.

asr-000323
00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:10.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: This slide Madam Chair, Your Honors, presents some of the highlights of the 2027 NEP.

asr-000324
00:21:10.000 --> 00:21:12.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Starting with personnel improvements.

asr-000325
00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:19.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So, we start with the expanded career progression where we target to promote more than 135,000 teachers and school heads

asr-000326
00:21:19.000 --> 00:21:23.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: with a corresponding allocation of 12.09 billion.

asr-000327
00:21:23.000 --> 00:21:33.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Naglaan din po tayo ng 3.75 billion para sa training ng mahigit 500,000 teachers and laptops for 50,000 teachers, Your Honor.

asr-000328
00:21:33.000 --> 00:21:41.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: For the learning environment, we have 17.31 billion to put up over 4,000 classrooms.

asr-000329
00:21:41.000 --> 00:21:47.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Sa aspeto naman po ng digital transformation, bukod sa nabanggit na laptops,

asr-000330
00:21:47.000 --> 00:21:56.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: meron din pong 3.37 billion para sa internet renewal of over 14,000 schools, ICT solutions and capacity building.

asr-000331
00:21:56.000 --> 00:22:03.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: We also have allocated 6.4 billion for the production and procurement of textbooks and workbooks and other learning materials.

asr-000332
00:22:03.000 --> 00:22:10.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And for inclusive education, we have 2.63 billion to support special needs education,

asr-000333
00:22:10.000 --> 00:22:20.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: indigenous peoples education, madrasa education, multigrade education, alternative modes and alternative learning systems or ALS.

asr-000334
00:22:20.000 --> 00:22:25.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: For the feeding program, 11.43 billion was allocated to support 3.69 million learners.

asr-000335
00:22:25.000 --> 00:22:31.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: We're also asking additional for inclusive education as well as governance and innovation.

asr-000336
00:22:31.000 --> 00:22:35.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And of course, our attached agencies also have their respective requests, Your Honor.

asr-000337
00:22:35.000 --> 00:22:39.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: The National Book Development Board is requesting an additional 186 million.

asr-000338
00:22:40.000 --> 00:22:44.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: For book fairs, readership promotion, policy development, research and advocacy,

asr-000339
00:22:44.000 --> 00:22:49.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: the National Council for Children's Television is requesting an additional 61 million

asr-000340
00:22:49.000 --> 00:22:54.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: for child-friendly, educational and values-oriented TV content, research and ICT support.

asr-000341
00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:59.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: The National Museum of the Philippines is requesting an additional 255 million

asr-000342
00:22:59.000 --> 00:23:05.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: for digital transformation, public access, museum engagement and component museums nationwide.

asr-000343
00:23:05.000 --> 00:23:10.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: The Philippine High School for the Arts is requesting an additional 161 million

asr-000344
00:23:10.000 --> 00:23:15.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: for campus rehabilitation, facilities and equipment, student support and quality arts education.

asr-000345
00:23:15.000 --> 00:23:19.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: The National Academy of Sports is requesting an additional 580 million

asr-000346
00:23:19.000 --> 00:23:24.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: for sports development, competitions, student-athlete support, curriculum and facilities.

asr-000347
00:23:24.000 --> 00:23:29.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And the Teacher Education Council is requesting an additional 498 million for salaries,

asr-000348
00:23:29.000 --> 00:23:33.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: teacher education and graduate scholarships, and regional hubs.

asr-000349
00:23:33.000 --> 00:23:39.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So, ito po yung some of the salient points

asr-000350
00:23:39.000 --> 00:23:45.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: of the 27 budget, Your Honor, and the resource persons, including myself,

asr-000351
00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:50.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: are most willing to answer any questions from the distinguished members of the committee.

asr-000352
00:23:50.000 --> 00:23:52.000
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Madam Chair, thank you very much.

asr-000353
00:23:52.000 --> 00:24:01.820
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Thank you very much, Secretary Angara.

