asr-000379
00:25:33.320 --> 00:25:39.320
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: gusto ko lamang pong batiin lahat ng mga guro na narito na Happy Teacher's Month po sa inyo.

asr-000380
00:25:39.320 --> 00:25:44.210
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Para pong mahina yung palakpak for our teachers,

asr-000381
00:25:44.210 --> 00:25:49.510
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: pwede na pong magsimula yung five minutes, Madam Chair.

asr-000382
