asr-000384
00:26:01.510 --> 00:26:12.510
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Madam Chair, nakababahala po na mismo ang EDCOM 2 nakita na ang Pilipinas na ngayon ang bullying capital of the world.

asr-000385
00:26:12.510 --> 00:26:16.510
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Inuulit ko po, hindi ito magandang klase ng gold medal.

asr-000386
00:26:16.510 --> 00:26:19.510
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ito yung gold medal na dapat hindi natin sinusuot with pride.

asr-000387
00:26:19.510 --> 00:26:23.510
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Again, the Philippines is the bullying capital of the world.

asr-000388
00:26:23.510 --> 00:26:33.510
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: This is saddening as it is alarming dahil alam nating bumababa ang learning competencies ng ating mga studyante kapag nabubully sila.

asr-000389
00:26:33.510 --> 00:26:43.510
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Bullying is also among the reasons pointed out why the recent cases of school violence happened and why it is alarmingly increasing.

asr-000390
00:26:43.510 --> 00:26:48.510
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Kaya nga po, kahit ako hindi nakaligtas sa bullying,

asr-000391
00:26:48.510 --> 00:26:56.510
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: from no less than a school principal, shout out po sa principal ang Dimasalang High School, National High School po sa Masbate.

asr-000392
00:26:56.510 --> 00:27:06.510
