asr-000393
00:27:06.510 --> 00:27:14.400
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: We have a lot of programs and we're looking at, magandang umaga, Perci.

asr-000394
00:27:14.400 --> 00:27:18.400
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: We're looking at full implementation of the anti-bullying law, revised anti-bullying law.

asr-000395
00:27:18.400 --> 00:27:28.400
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And in the last year, we've seen a, dumami na po talaga yung functioning child protection committees which is a requirement of the anti-bullying law.

asr-000396
00:27:28.400 --> 00:27:38.400
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: I think if I'm not mistaken, we have over 30,000, there are over 36,000 of our schools already have functioning child protection committees.

asr-000397
00:27:38.400 --> 00:27:46.400
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And ang ginawa po namin dahil nakita po ng EDCOM nga na iilan lang po ang dati-dati-rati, about a year and a half ago, ang may functioning child protection committees.

asr-000398
00:27:46.400 --> 00:27:56.400
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So, that's one. And the second is under the new mental health and well-being law, we're ramping up the hiring.

asr-000399
00:27:56.400 --> 00:28:00.400
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: In fact, we shortened the time for the hiring of the school council associates.

asr-000400
00:28:00.400 --> 00:28:08.400
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Normally, this would take three to four months because our HROD, headed by Willie Cabral, looked for a way to shorten the hiring process.

asr-000401
00:28:08.400 --> 00:28:14.400
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Naibaba na namin sa halos 30 days, Your Honor, yung hiring process ng school council associates.

asr-000402
00:28:14.400 --> 00:28:15.400
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So, definitely, we're looking at that. We're looking at that. We're looking at that. We're looking at that. We're looking at that. We're looking at that.

asr-000403
00:28:16.400 --> 00:28:24.400
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So, definitely, I think dapat palakasin talaga yung approach in schools and building a stronger sense of community, Your Honor.

asr-000404
00:28:24.400 --> 00:28:26.400
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So, these are some of the things we're trying to do.

asr-000405
00:28:26.400 --> 00:28:35.400
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And of course, training our, kahit yung mga eskwelahan na walang guidance counsellor, which is a systemic problem, as pointed out also by EDCOM.

asr-000406
00:28:35.400 --> 00:28:43.400
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: E, itatrain na lang sa suho natin sana yung mga guro, how to deal with problems like this.

asr-000407
00:28:43.400 --> 00:28:44.400
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And of course, we're also trying to foster the larger community.

asr-000408
00:28:44.400 --> 00:28:50.400
