DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: It comes from the school MOOE, Your Honor.

asr-001372
01:17:48.270 --> 01:17:49.810
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Not OSEC, Madam Chair.

asr-001373
01:17:50.410 --> 01:17:51.270
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: No, no, ma'am.

asr-001374
01:17:59.720 --> 01:18:03.430
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Pero is it plugged under the MOOE or [unclear]?

asr-001374-split-2
01:18:03.430 --> 01:18:05.880
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: MOOE, ma'am, ang funding source niya.

asr-001375
01:18:05.880 --> 01:18:07.880
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And maganda naman ho, dahil...

asr-001376
01:18:08.880 --> 01:18:24.320
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: If you will recall, Madam Chair, Your Honor, we postponed the school drill in response to the call of the Psychiatrists Association na huwag na sanang tumuloy because of the possible trauma.

asr-001377
01:18:25.080 --> 01:18:31.540
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So we toned down the drill just to ensure that there is a system response, Your Honor.

asr-001378
01:18:31.800 --> 01:18:34.920
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Mahirap naman ho yung talagang magulat tayo kung nangyari.

asr-001379
01:18:35.000 --> 01:18:37.740
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Alam na natin nangyari, tapos hindi pa natin paghahandaan.

asr-001380
01:18:38.100 --> 01:18:38.820
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Ang gusto talaga nila.

asr-001381
01:18:38.880 --> 01:18:40.120
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Yes, huwag mag-drill at all.

asr-001382
01:18:40.660 --> 01:18:48.700
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: But we met with them and lahat nung suggestions, as many of their suggestions that we could incorporate, inincorporate po natin.

asr-001383
01:18:48.980 --> 01:18:50.240
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And tama ko kayo.

asr-001384
01:18:51.460 --> 01:18:54.620
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Siguro, we should have paid more attention to this earlier.

asr-001385
01:18:55.140 --> 01:18:57.220
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And there's a lot...

asr-001386
01:18:57.220 --> 01:18:59.720
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And I mentioned earlier yung use of social media.

asr-001387
01:18:59.720 --> 01:19:02.540
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: This is really something which hurts our youth, Your Honor.

asr-001388
01:19:02.720 --> 01:19:06.080
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: The unabashed and unrestricted use of social media.

asr-001389
01:19:07.760 --> 01:19:08.720
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Not all social media.

asr-001390
01:19:08.880 --> 01:19:10.080
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Your Honor, I want to qualify.

asr-001391
01:19:10.260 --> 01:19:16.200
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: But social media which introduces our youth to pernicious influences.

asr-001392
01:19:17.060 --> 01:19:20.060
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Yung tinatawag na nihilistic violent associations.

asr-001393
01:19:20.520 --> 01:19:23.300
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Yung 764, which we saw in the Tacloban shooting.

asr-001394
01:19:23.980 --> 01:19:25.460
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Yung mga terrorist groups.

asr-001395
01:19:25.720 --> 01:19:30.560
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Yung osaek or sexual predators.

asr-001396
01:19:31.220 --> 01:19:32.260
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So these are all...

asr-001397
01:19:32.260 --> 01:19:34.420
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Sabi nga nila, a sociologist said,

asr-001398
01:19:34.420 --> 01:19:38.560
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: We've been so busy protecting our children.

asr-001399
01:19:38.560 --> 01:19:43.640
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: From external influences, we forgot to protect them internally, Your Honor.

asr-001400
01:19:43.640 --> 01:19:46.240
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And so it's time to, again, play catch up.

asr-001401
01:19:46.240 --> 01:19:48.240
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And I thank you for your concern.

asr-001402
01:19:48.240 --> 01:19:54.740
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: I think this is probably one of the most important issues DepEd has to face, in addition to the learning outcomes.

asr-001403
01:19:54.740 --> 01:19:56.740
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: In trying to improve our learning outcomes.

asr-001404
01:19:56.740 --> 01:19:59.740
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Building the sense of community in a school.

asr-001405
01:19:59.740 --> 01:20:04.440
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: But we have to say, we need the help of the whole society.

asr-001406
01:20:04.440 --> 01:20:06.440
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: We are willing to do our share.

asr-001407
01:20:06.440 --> 01:20:08.440
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: But we also need parents to be involved.

asr-001408
01:20:08.440 --> 01:20:10.440
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: We need families to be involved.

asr-001409
01:20:10.440 --> 01:20:12.440
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: We need the barangays to be involved.

asr-001410
01:20:12.440 --> 01:20:18.440
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Kasi nga, yung pangalawang tahanan yung mga skwelahan.

asr-001411
01:20:18.440 --> 01:20:24.440
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Pero hindi natin makontrol yung ginagawa sa pangunahing tahanan, Your Honor, Madam Chair.

asr-001412
