Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Madam Chair, can I ask kung na-finalize na po ba ng DepEd yung guidelines na binababa niya sa mga schools sa paggawa ng mga drills?

asr-001413
01:20:34.440 --> 01:20:36.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: So siyempre, na-appreciate natin

asr-001414
01:20:36.440 --> 01:20:37.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: yung

asr-001415
01:20:37.440 --> 01:20:38.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: adjustment

asr-001416
01:20:38.440 --> 01:20:39.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na hindi na po siya

asr-001417
01:20:39.440 --> 01:20:42.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: active shooter drills.

asr-001418
01:20:42.440 --> 01:20:54.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: I'd like to note ang studies po na nakita natin from the United States itself na nagkondukt ng mga drills na ito and mas frequent yung shooting na nangyayari sa kanila.

asr-001419
01:20:54.440 --> 01:20:59.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: May caution na pinapa-emphasize sa lahat ng mga magiging implementing

asr-001420
01:20:59.440 --> 01:21:02.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: agencies ng mga drills na ito.

asr-001421
01:21:02.440 --> 01:21:07.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: because the effectiveness of these is thin and difficult to establish while evidence of psychological and behavioral harm.

asr-001422
01:21:07.440 --> 01:21:13.040
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and behavioral harm namely fear traumatic stress response the disproportionate impact on students

asr-001423
01:21:13.040 --> 01:21:19.140
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: with disabilities and prior trauma is real and growing this is from a 2024 consensus report

asr-001424
01:21:19.140 --> 01:21:25.160
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: of the u.s national academies of sciences so i'd like to ask madam chair are these studies

asr-001425
01:21:25.160 --> 01:21:31.600
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: now taken into consideration? Meron po bang final guidelines na pwedeng ma-share sa body?

asr-001426
01:21:31.600 --> 01:21:37.440
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And siyempre, paano yung communications ng iba't ibang stakeholders

asr-001427
01:21:37.440 --> 01:21:44.840
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na naging reason kung bakit nag-reconsider ang DepEd sa prior plan of active shooter drills? Madam Chair.

asr-001428
01:21:44.840 --> 01:21:52.100
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Yes, Madam Chair. Thank you. Nag-issue na po tayo, and this issuance took into account the outputs

asr-001429
01:21:52.100 --> 01:21:58.620
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: of the medical associations, as you mentioned, Your Honor, at pinakita rin namin sa kanila yung issuances natin.

asr-001430
01:21:58.620 --> 01:22:01.580
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: uh but definitely we're

asr-001431
01:22:01.580 --> 01:22:07.680
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: it's it's i think it's still a work in progress in the sense that it's it's all new to us

