asr-004668
05:14:26.850 --> 05:14:31.630
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: think through this effort or through this program mas marami tayong

asr-004669
05:14:31.630 --> 05:14:34.370
Rep. Alyssa Michaela "Mica" M. Gonzales: matutulungan, dahil I think that is what we need.

asr-004670
05:14:34.370 --> 05:14:38.690
