Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Mr. Chair, Magandang tanghali po sa DepEd family.

asr-004676
05:15:12.070 --> 05:15:25.270
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Isa lang ho ang katanungan ko at wala pa ho kasi tayong maliwanag na batas hinggil

asr-004677
05:15:25.270 --> 05:15:36.030
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: doon sa, hinggil puro sa nangyayari sa ating mga eskwelahan.

asr-004678
05:15:36.030 --> 05:15:46.830
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Sumikat yung Tacloban, sumikat yung ibang mga lugar sa Ateneo, sa Mwanga, sa mga concern

asr-004679
05:15:46.830 --> 05:15:48.590
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: ng bawat tao.

asr-004680
05:15:48.590 --> 05:15:55.210
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Ngayon po, kahapon po ay sa isang compound.

asr-004681
05:15:55.270 --> 05:16:11.790
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Sa NAUST, bilang limang, lima po ang university sa Kabanatuan, isa pong nagmamahalan na isa

asr-004682
05:16:11.790 --> 05:16:23.230
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: ay galing sa Pampanga at yung isa ay galing doon sa Nueva Ecija, binaril po, binaril po

asr-004683
05:16:23.230 --> 05:16:25.230
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: yung kanyang girlfriend.

asr-004686
05:16:25.770 --> 05:16:37.230
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Tapos binaril po sa, nagbaril po sa sarili yung batang lalaki.

asr-004687
05:16:37.230 --> 05:16:54.910
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: So, in the absence, in the absence of the law, all encompassing law, I would like to appeal,

asr-004688
05:16:55.250 --> 05:17:08.710
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: na sana po ay magkaroon ng talagang inter-agency task force na talaga pong mag-ayos nito.

asr-004689
05:17:09.490 --> 05:17:11.670
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Mr. Che, yun po lang.

asr-004690
05:17:14.300 --> 05:17:18.660
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Thank you, Your Honor, Congressman Jay, Madam Chair.

asr-004691
05:17:19.120 --> 05:17:26.280
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: I think you're right, and definitely, in fact, tomorrow we have a scheduled meeting with DICTE, CHED, and other agencies.

asr-004692
05:17:26.880 --> 05:17:31.380
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: To talk about the online aspect of the violence, Your Honor, kasi bahagi rin yun.

asr-004693
05:17:31.840 --> 05:17:40.080
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Kung anong nakikita ng mga bata online, minsan yun ang gusto nilang mangyari sa labas ng silidaraan o sa loob at labas.

asr-004694
05:17:40.080 --> 05:17:50.960
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So, definitely, we're most willing to coordinate kasi this incidence of school shootings, maraming aspeto yun eh.

asr-004695
05:17:51.060 --> 05:17:54.820
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Yung security aspect ng school, yung mental health ng ating learners,

asr-004696
05:17:54.820 --> 05:18:04.920
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: yung ability of our teachers to connect the sense of community within a school, yung gun control measures po natin.

asr-004697
05:18:06.320 --> 05:18:08.700
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Kung baga tahi-tahi na po itong mga issue natin.

asr-004698
05:18:08.860 --> 05:18:11.400
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So, we thank you for your concern, sir.

asr-004699
05:18:11.400 --> 05:18:24.400
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: So, gusto ko lamang po sana na ito po ay inampisaan ng aking asawa na si former congressman,

asr-004700
05:18:24.820 --> 05:18:26.600
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Congresswoman Vergara.

asr-004701
05:18:27.700 --> 05:18:31.520
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Ito po ay taong dalawang libo't labimpito.

asr-004702
05:18:33.020 --> 05:18:43.800
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Dahil po hindi ho pa nariresolba pa namin, kaya ganoon ang naging aking mungkahi.

asr-004703
05:18:44.800 --> 05:18:54.800
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: So, hayaan lamang po niyong ipakita ko yung salita ng aking asawa noong 2017.

asr-004704
05:18:54.820 --> 05:19:10.400
Rep. Rosanna "Ria" V. Vergara: The internet is a double-edged sword, a tool for convenience which anyone with Wi-Fi access or a data plan may use, and if done so improperly, abuse.

asr-004705
05:19:10.400 --> 05:19:21.900
Presentation video: Noong May 15, 2017, naghatid ng isang privileged speech si Congresswoman Vergara upang magbigay babala sa mga panganib na dulot ng internet, lalo na sa mga kabataan.

asr-004706
05:19:23.520 --> 05:19:26.900
Presentation video: Isa sa mga sinusulong na batas ni Congresswoman Rosana Ria Vergara

asr-004707
05:19:26.940 --> 05:19:38.560
Presentation video: ay ang House Bill 5666, o an act to integrate internet and social media education as part of the curriculum of all primary and secondary schools, public and private.

asr-004708
05:19:38.820 --> 05:19:49.540
Presentation video: Ang pangunahing layuni ng panukalang batas na ito ay bumuo ng isang pangasiwaan na magbabantay at magtuturo sa mga mag-aaral ng wasto at maingat na paggamit ng internet.

asr-004709
05:19:49.540 --> 05:19:56.920
Rep. Rosanna "Ria" V. Vergara: I will file a House Bill that will require the Department of Education, a subject that will specifically deal with the internet.

asr-004710
05:19:56.940 --> 05:20:06.960
Rep. Rosanna "Ria" V. Vergara: and social media awareness, and the dangers and risks posed to the young by internet access that include the danger of internet gaming.

asr-004711
05:20:07.380 --> 05:20:13.120
Presentation video: Ilan sa mga panganib na kanyang tinukoy ay ang pagsusugal at adiksyon sa mga internet games.

asr-004712
05:20:13.680 --> 05:20:18.500
Rep. Rosanna "Ria" V. Vergara: How can a game be the reason for skipping class and losing money?

asr-004713
05:20:19.080 --> 05:20:21.240
Rep. Rosanna "Ria" V. Vergara: Because it involves gambling.

asr-004714
05:20:21.940 --> 05:20:25.600
Rep. Rosanna "Ria" V. Vergara: And because it is designed by the developers to be addictive.

asr-004715
05:20:25.600 --> 05:20:35.680
Presentation video: Kabilang din dito ang Blue Whale Challenge na nag-uudyok sa mga sumasali dito na saktan ang sarili at ang pinakamalala ay udyukan silang magpakamatay.

asr-004716
05:20:35.680 --> 05:20:41.160
Rep. Rosanna "Ria" V. Vergara: Recently, a new social media game called Blue Whale was developed.

asr-004717
05:20:41.940 --> 05:20:45.960
Rep. Rosanna "Ria" V. Vergara: The players are tasked to do 50 strange things.

asr-004718
05:20:46.540 --> 05:20:54.220
Rep. Rosanna "Ria" V. Vergara: Hurting themselves, waking up at early hours to watch horror films, to win the game, commit suicide.

asr-004719
05:20:55.600 --> 05:21:01.440
Presentation video: Kamakailan lamang, may isa na namang internet app na may kahalintulad na tema, ang Momo Challenge.

asr-004720
05:21:01.440 --> 05:21:08.940
Presentation video: Nanawagan naman ngayon ang Philippine National Police sa mga magulang na bantayang mabuti ang kanilang mga anak sa paggamit ng internet.

asr-004721
05:21:09.420 --> 05:21:14.820
Presentation video: Matapos ito sa nababalitang issue sa online na tinatawag na Momo Challenge.

asr-004722
05:21:15.020 --> 05:21:22.440
Presentation video: Ang challenge ay naghihikayat sa mga bata na gumawa ng mga task kasama na rito ang pananakit sa sarili at pagpapakamatay.

asr-004723
05:21:23.340 --> 05:21:24.460
Presentation video: Totoo man o hindi?

asr-004724
05:21:25.040 --> 05:21:25.440
Presentation video: Ang panganib.

asr-004725
05:21:25.600 --> 05:21:35.220
Presentation video: Ang panganib na dala sa mga menor de edad ng computer gaming at internet ay mananatiling na riyan kung hindi natin mababantayan at gagabayan ang mga kabataan.

asr-004726
05:21:35.840 --> 05:21:42.820
Rep. Rosanna "Ria" V. Vergara: As legislators, concerned parents, we must be vigilant that there is another kind of war going on.

asr-004727
05:21:43.280 --> 05:21:54.540
Rep. Rosanna "Ria" V. Vergara: In this war, it is the minds, hearts, and lives of our children, the youth, the most vulnerable individuals in our society that are being targeted.

asr-004728
05:21:54.540 --> 05:21:55.040
Rep. Rosanna "Ria" V. Vergara: We must be vigilant.

asr-004729
05:21:55.040 --> 05:22:01.140
Rep. Rosanna "Ria" V. Vergara: We must do everything to protect our children from the dangers of internet and social media gaming.

asr-004730
05:22:01.700 --> 05:22:07.840
Rep. Rosanna "Ria" V. Vergara: We must respond immediately for the future of an entire generation is at stake.

asr-004731
05:22:07.840 --> 05:22:14.710
Presentation video: Isang lingkod bayan na nakatanaw sa...

asr-004732
05:22:14.710 --> 05:22:28.550
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Taon-taon po ay aming ipina-file 'yan, kaya po naging suggestion ko na hangga't wala po, sana magkaroon ng interagency task force.

asr-004733
05:22:29.230 --> 05:22:39.770
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Other than that, I manifest my support, full support, for the budget of the Department of Education.

asr-004734
05:22:40.270 --> 05:22:41.270
Rep. Julius Cesar "Jay" V. Vergara: Maraming salamat po.

asr-004735
05:22:42.030 --> 05:22:44.450
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Maraming salamat po, Kong J. Vergara.

asr-004736
05:22:44.890 --> 05:22:45.410
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Salamat.

asr-004737
05:22:45.730 --> 05:22:49.710
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: At we support the advocacy of Kong Ria and yourself.

asr-004738
05:22:50.470 --> 05:22:55.390
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Dapat mapulis po talaga natin yung use of social media by our youth.

asr-004739
05:22:55.590 --> 05:22:56.250
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Maraming salamat po.

asr-004740
05:22:57.250 --> 05:22:58.410
Rep. Maria Carmen S. Zamora: Thank you very much.

asr-004741
