Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Regarding po dun sa...

asr-004746
05:23:16.680 --> 05:23:17.460
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Mr. Chair.

asr-004747
05:23:17.860 --> 05:23:18.540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Ay, Madam Chair.

asr-004748
05:23:19.100 --> 05:23:26.880
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Regarding sa ating yung Department of Indigenous Peoples Education, or the IPED,

asr-004749
05:23:27.440 --> 05:23:32.220
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: we recognize that indigenous peoples have the right to an education that is accessible.

asr-004750
05:23:32.980 --> 05:23:34.540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then my question is that...

asr-004751
05:23:35.100 --> 05:23:51.680
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: DepEd, actually investing in this program, but then, ang katanungan ko po, doon sa ating special needs, for the special needs education,

asr-004752
05:23:51.680 --> 05:24:03.560
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: can a DepEd increase the funding for the assessment of children with disabilities and for the procurement of the assistive learning devices and technologies?

asr-004753
05:24:03.560 --> 05:24:04.900
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: How many learners?

asr-004754
05:24:04.900 --> 05:24:09.380
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: How many learners have currently waiting for assessment?

asr-004755
05:24:09.380 --> 05:24:14.680
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And how many assessed learners still do not have the assistive devices?

asr-004756
05:24:14.680 --> 05:24:16.820
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Sa ngayon po.

asr-004757
05:24:16.820 --> 05:24:22.280
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: For the indigenous peoples education for the IPED, because sa aming distrito po,

asr-004758
05:24:22.280 --> 05:24:30.180
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: parang doon sa SDS po namin is they're going to include as a curriculum sa IPED,

asr-004759
05:24:30.180 --> 05:24:32.900
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: this indigenous peoples education.

asr-004760
05:24:32.900 --> 05:24:37.420
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Can we substantially increase din po, and then

asr-004785
05:24:37.420 --> 05:24:54.000
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: mag-stand alone po siya, kasi included siya doon sa isang program po ninyo, as isang, isa lang po siya na, how do you call this, nakasali siya dito sa, ano ba yan?

asr-004786
05:24:54.860 --> 05:24:55.660
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Anong program?

asr-004787
05:24:57.060 --> 05:24:57.680
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: This one.

asr-004788
05:24:57.980 --> 05:24:59.140
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Inclusive education.

asr-004789
05:24:59.480 --> 05:25:02.460
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So 983.8 million.

asr-004790
05:25:03.660 --> 05:25:04.780
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Ito po yung budget.

asr-004791
05:25:04.780 --> 05:25:17.460
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: But then, nandito na rin kasi, nandaloob na rin ang special needs, madrasah education, indigenous peoples education, and the multi-grade program.

asr-004792
05:25:18.200 --> 05:25:21.780
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So, and alternative learning system.

asr-004793
05:25:22.560 --> 05:25:30.540
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Can we increase also budget para dito po, Madam Chair, to our Secretary?

asr-004794
05:25:31.520 --> 05:25:34.140
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Thank you, Your Honor, Madam Chair.

asr-004795
05:25:34.140 --> 05:25:39.740
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Yung IP education or indigenous people's education, meron ng sariling line item ho yan.

asr-004796
05:25:40.040 --> 05:25:42.620
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Ganun din ho yung special needs education.

asr-004797
05:25:43.260 --> 05:25:49.680
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: At nag-request ho kami ng 154 million for IPED, pero ang nag-grant lang ho is 76 million.

asr-004798
05:25:49.820 --> 05:25:54.260
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: That's why part of our appeal is the additional 78 million for IP education.

asr-004799
05:25:54.880 --> 05:26:02.860
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Tapos sa SNED naman ho, ang nirequest ho namin is 1.39 billion, at ang nag-grant ho is 849.9 million.

asr-004800
05:26:02.860 --> 05:26:12.120
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Kaya meron tayong pending appeal for 541 million additional budget for this SNED special needs education, Your Honor.

asr-004801
05:26:13.280 --> 05:26:15.120
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Thank you, Madam Chair.

asr-004802
05:26:15.320 --> 05:26:22.500
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Kasi itong special needs, we really need mag-additional sana po tayo ng budget for this program.

asr-004803
05:26:23.040 --> 05:26:31.440
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Kasi ang daming ho nating mga kabataan na they really need this additional funding for this program po.

asr-004804
05:26:31.440 --> 05:26:32.440
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Especially also...

asr-004805
05:26:32.860 --> 05:26:36.320
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So, mga indigenous po na may special needs.

asr-004806
05:26:37.120 --> 05:26:41.860
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then my second question, I would also...

asr-004807
05:26:42.700 --> 05:26:48.200
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Regarding po dun sa katanungan ni Sir, ni Congressman Rufus kanina,

asr-004808
05:26:48.680 --> 05:26:56.680
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: regarding the allocation, yung bidding for the school buildings for 2026,

asr-004809
05:26:57.200 --> 05:27:02.680
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: tapos may mga FLR din for the 2025 na hindi na rin...

asr-004810
05:27:02.860 --> 05:27:04.420
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Lumabas under 2026.

asr-004811
05:27:05.100 --> 05:27:14.420
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then ngayon sa 2027 proposed NEP, wala din yung mga school buildings na yung mga na-wash out during the typhoon.

asr-004812
05:27:15.440 --> 05:27:21.840
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then may katanungan din po ako, the computation approximately 2.5 million per school building po ba?

asr-004813
05:27:22.740 --> 05:27:28.140
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Sa isang building, even in the mountainous area.

asr-004814
05:27:28.140 --> 05:27:32.140
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Kasi may mga areas na malalayo yung mga...

asr-004815
05:27:32.860 --> 05:27:36.980
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Lugar na walang road, walang access to roads.

asr-004816
05:27:37.160 --> 05:27:40.480
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: And then meron din mga GEDA areas.

asr-004817
05:27:41.280 --> 05:27:43.920
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Hindi naman sila kasali din sa last mile.

asr-004818
05:27:44.480 --> 05:27:46.240
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Though it's a regular fund.

asr-004819
05:27:47.440 --> 05:27:56.960
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: May possibility ho ba, Madam Chair, na yung costing mechanism for the school buildings located sa mga GEDA areas,

asr-004820
05:27:56.960 --> 05:28:02.840
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: lalo na yung mga wala pang roads going to that school.

asr-004821
05:28:02.860 --> 05:28:04.080
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Na gagawin.

asr-004822
05:28:04.620 --> 05:28:12.800
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Because yung costing po nila, mag-a-add pa ng manual hauling, multiple handling.

asr-004823
05:28:13.740 --> 05:28:15.300
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Ganun po, Madam Chair.

asr-004824
05:28:15.820 --> 05:28:22.320
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: So, ang katanungan ko po, Madam Chair, kung kay sa ating DepEd family,

asr-004825
05:28:23.020 --> 05:28:28.160
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: meron ho ba talaga bang uniform the whole Philippines, even you are in the island,

asr-004826
05:28:28.160 --> 05:28:30.980
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: nasa mountainous area, panawalang daan.

asr-004827
05:28:31.740 --> 05:28:32.840
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Same ho ba?

asr-004828
05:28:32.860 --> 05:28:35.860
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Madam Chair, na 2.5 per classroom.

asr-004829
05:28:36.020 --> 05:28:36.440
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Madam Chair.

asr-004830
05:28:36.640 --> 05:28:37.020
Rep. Caroline B. Agyao: Thank you.

asr-004831
05:28:38.000 --> 05:28:39.560
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Yeah, there's a range.

asr-004832
05:28:39.840 --> 05:28:42.620
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: I think now it's 3 to 3.5 million.

asr-004833
05:28:42.780 --> 05:28:45.660
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: This was a figure agreed upon with DPWH.

asr-004834
05:28:45.840 --> 05:28:48.580
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Pero meron talagang mga lugar na malalayo.

asr-004835
05:28:49.060 --> 05:28:50.500
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Yung freight, maaring iba.

asr-004836
05:28:50.960 --> 05:28:53.900
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Tapos yung iba, baka iba rin yung fundasyon.

asr-004837
05:28:54.100 --> 05:28:55.620
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: So, mas nagmamahal yun.

asr-004838
05:28:55.620 --> 05:29:01.100
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: And yung binanggit niyo po, Cong Agyao, about the last mile school.

asr-004839
05:29:01.620 --> 05:29:02.740
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Pag-GEDA school.

asr-004840
05:29:02.860 --> 05:29:03.660
DepEd Secretary Sonny Angara: Na walang kalsada.

